				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "zG1SYyckT+eQQC/t6lHT/w=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "If starting a netldi fails with `bind(...) failed with Address already in use`, another netldi is already using that port. Often it belongs to a different GT image or GemStone installation on the same machine. The steps below find that process, show how it was started, and stop it cleanly."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:37:31.777294+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:39:51.251538+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "/7DgbHD8TeO8hy0sHbSVVQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "The port number is in the netldi log excerpt (e.g. `Using OS translation of service name gs64ldi to port ...`). `-n -P` show raw addresses and port numbers. Only lines in the `LISTEN` state matter; any other lines are client connections."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "shellCommandSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:37:31.858289+01:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:37:31.858289+01:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "zHQNmIz0Qo2qb+b0QT8GxA=="
							},
							"code" : "PORT=50377\nlsof -nP -iTCP:$PORT -sTCP:LISTEN"
						}
					]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:39:51.245431+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-04T14:51:38.998961+01:00"
